  "evidencia": "Page: What's It Gonna Be (H &quot;Two&quot; O song). Sentence: is a bassline (subgenre of UK garage) song performed by the duo known as H \"Two\" O (Selim Ben Rabha, \"Solution\", and Simon McDevitt, \"Oz\", who also go by \"Hit 'Em\" and \"Hard\") and the British three-person bassline vocal group Platnum (Aaron Evers, Mina Poli, and Michelle McKenna).\nPage: Bassline (music genre). Sentence: Bassline (sometimes referred to as bassline house, Niche or 4x4) is a type of music related to UK garage that originated in Sheffield in the early 2000s.",
